>> title: Marble Cake
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: chocolate, vanilla, sour cream, oven
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 20 min

Grease a #9x5-in loaf pan{}.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Whisk @unsweetened cocoa powder{3%Tbs}(18 g), @boiling water{3%Tbs}(45 mL), @granulated sugar{2%Tbs}(25 g) into a smooth paste.

Beat @unsalted butter{3/4%cup}(170 g; softened), @granulated sugar{1%cup}(200 g) until fluffy.

Beat @eggs{3%large}, @vanilla extract{2%tsp}(10 mL), @sour cream{1/2%cup}(120 g) into @&(~1)creamed butter{}.

Fold @all-purpose flour{2%cup}(250 g), @baking powder{1 1/2%tsp}(6 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g) into @&(~1)batter{}.

Swirl @&(3)cocoa paste{} through @&(~1)batter{} with a knife.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{60%min}.
